        "message": "Refactor(sim/backend): Migrate simulation from synthetic Bengaluru to Delhi (Rajiv Chowk)\n\n- Updated all core coordinates from Bengaluru (12.9716, 77.5946) to Delhi Rajiv Chowk (28.6328, 77.2197).\n- Shifted grid size from 8x8 to 10x10 and tightened spacing to 0.005 (~555m) for 3-5km coverage.\n- Updated metro lines from Purple/Green to Yellow/Blue (DMRC).\n- Fixed a severe bug in network.py where weather events triggered a full network rebuild.\n- Updated data pipeline to pull a 4km radius network (for 3-5km coverage).\n- Created a comprehensive REQUIREMENTS.md cross-team contract and simulation/requirements.txt.",
